report.summary:
All eight wallet notes for run 'ui' are fixed on branch p2-ui, one commit each, on top of 3c0f97c. The worktree is <scratch>/wt/p2-ui. In all: 124 lines added and 70 removed, across 8 files.

- C7 (ui/admin.go SignParameters): the wallet now refuses a parameter draft and says "draft it again" if any of these holds: its Sequence is not state.GovernanceSequence, its PreviousParametersDigest is not state.Parameters.Digest(), or its NewParameters fail Acceptable(len(checkpoint.Validators)). The check runs before the wallet looks up its name or signs anything.
- C11 (ui/main.go index): any path other than exactly "/" gets http.NotFound, so /favicon.ico no longer reads and verifies a checkpoint.
- C12, the Governance part (ui/admin.go Wallet.Governance): an answer with status 300 or more is refused with "the node answered <status>". The body is read through io.LimitReader(maxStateBytes), the same bound verifiedState uses.
- C15: Wallet.Governance returns node.GovernanceView. adminPageData holds node.ParametersView, []node.ParameterProposalView and []node.ReassignmentView. The four copied types are deleted (45 lines). admin.html needed no change because the field names are the same.
- C30: LastPaymentBlockID's comment now points to ui/USER_MANUAL.md, "One key, one machine".
- C65: adminPageData.PublicKey and its assignment in renderAdmin are deleted.
- C66 (ledger/name_request.go): NameRequestFitsState compares request.fee() instead of request.Fee, so a null fee on a registration, key change or bank change is refused as "not the network's new-key fee" instead of panicking. One comment line on fee() changed to "zero when it is null (a freeze has none)".
- C69: pageData.PublicKey's comment now says render finds the wallet's name by the key, and the copy button copies it.

Docs: only docs/reading-the-code.md changed, each line in the commit that made it false:
- step 5 now names four tests, the new ledger test included;
- step 8 counts 124 ledger tests;
- step 21's row for the governance view now names Wallet.Governance and the node's GovernanceView (step 13);
- step 21's command adds GovernanceView and runs 40 tests;
- step 22's command adds UnknownPath and runs 12 tests.

Every count was checked with go test -list.

Gate, all passing at 74318aa:
- gofmt -l . prints nothing outside review/;
- both go vet and both go build commands pass;
- GOLEDGER_CHAOS_SLACK=4 go test -race -count=1 ./... passed twice, and the same with -C ui passed twice;
- the -count=3 Chaos|Restart|SignLog|Resume|CatchUp run of ./node/ passed.

Logs are in <scratch>/p2-scratch/ui-gate/.
